Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.AuthorReference
Column name: Refno Type: INT64 Description: this reference number is always an integer, between 1 and 50000
Column name: Name Type: STRING Description: eg 'Mitelman F', or 'Rowley JD'
Column name: NameOrder Type: INT64 Description: an integer between 1 and 228, indicating the position of this author's name in the list of authors for this reference
Sample rows:
[{'Refno': 1, 'Name': 'LUND UNPUBLISHED', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 1, 'Name': 'LUND UNPUBLISHED', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 10, 'Name': 'Hayata I', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 11, 'Name': 'Hayata I', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 12, 'Name': 'Muldal S', 'NameOrder': 1}]

